# The mock add-on is published as its own pub.dev package. Its archive
# should contain only the mock plugin's sources + MWDATMockDevice.xcframework
# (~12 MB). Stay well clear of the 100 MiB limit by excluding editor/OS
# noise and the example project's build artifacts.

.DS_Store
*.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/

# This package's own build output. `.pubignore` REPLACES `.gitignore` for pub,
# so `build/` being git-ignored does not keep it out of the archive — and pub
# reports no warning about it.
/build/

# Example app build artifacts that occasionally slip through
example/build/
example/ios/Pods/
example/ios/.symlinks/
example/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/
example/android/.gradle/
example/android/build/
example/android/app/build/
example/android/local.properties
